# DrumMania 10th Mix: the network PCB unit's data installer (--cd hdd, d40jca02), from what
# drmn10m-boot left. The game finds the unit's disk unformatted, formats it and copies the
# e-AMUSEMENT song data to it (DATA INSTALLATION MODE, 78 songs, 407 MB) until INSTALLATION
# COMPLETED (frame ~69000). The disk is the save folder's npu_hdd/ (runtime/sys573/npu.h).
# Beyond MAME, which has no network unit.
game drmn10m

from 0 every 3000 snap
at 70200 quit
